From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 18:04:34 +0300
Subject: Unlock and extend built-in translator

- remove premium gates from chat auto-translate and manual translate
- fix MLKit crash on ARM-translated x86 emulators; real devices unaffected
- route whole-chat auto-translate, per-message and poll translations
  through user-selectable providers (Google web, DeepL, OpenAI-compatible
  LLM) via EntinyTranslate engine; falls back to Telegram API when none set
- filter language pickers to only show languages the active provider supports
- show provider name instead of Cocoon branding in TranslateButton popup
- add FORCE_TRANSLATE config to bypass the own-language restriction
- add Translator settings row to SettingsActivity and LanguageSelectActivity
- add isFeatureAvailable gate tied to premium OR active third-party provider
---
